The condition for the lumped parameter model is \( Bi < 0.1 \):  
\[
\frac{hL}{k} = 0.1 \implies h = \frac{0.1 \times 95}{2.24 \times 10^{-3}} = 4241 \, \text{W/m}^2\text{K}
\]  
**Final answer**: \(\boxed{4241 \, \text{W/m}^2\text{K}}\)

(v) **Volumetric area ratio for lumped parameter model**:  
The condition \( Bi < 0.1 \) implies:  
\[
\frac{V}{A} = \frac{k \times 0.1}{h} = \frac{95 \times 0.1}{56.8} = 0.1672 \, \text{m}
\]  
