$$W = \int_{V_0}^{nV_0} P_{atm} dV = P_{atm} \int_{V_0}^{nV_0} dV = P_{0} (nV_0 - V_0) = P_0 (n-1) V_0$$
Since $P_0 V_0 = RT$, we have
$$W = RT (n-1)$$
Since the problem asks for the work to be calculated, we assume that the number of moles is 1.
The work is $W = (n-1) RT$.

